    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915270/extras/4c05718af2aadfdde3c59da7105c0d20.avif?t=1674500078\" /></div><br><br>Welcome to <i><strong>VocaBRAWLary</strong></i>, a fast and fun multiplayer typing game. Compete against your friends to become a <strong>Word Master</strong>. <br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compete against your friends (2 to 4 players) in a <strong>chat-based battle</strong>!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visit <strong>The Dojo</strong>, your one stop shop for all your ninja fighting needs!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your gaming experience with unique <strong>characters</strong>, fun <strong>accessories</strong> and scenic <strong>arenas</strong>.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pick from a wide variety of <strong>word lists</strong>, there is one for everyone from foodies to bookworms!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete <strong>missions</strong> and <strong>achievements</strong> for an added challenge!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/915270/extras/dec90e91827ea10dff896148891bf259.avif?t=1674500078\" /></div><br><br>Start chatting! What are you waiting for? An invitation?!",
